@startuml diagram_hire_lifecycle
title Hire Lifecycle — Game Maker, Session, Player

actor GameMaker as "Game Maker"
actor NewHire as "New Hire"
participant AdminHome as "AdminHomePage\n(/admin/:homeSid)"
participant HireDetail as "HireDetailPage\n(/admin/:homeSid/hire/:hireSid)"
participant Landing as "LandingPage\n(/join/:hireSid)"
participant Cockpit as "PlayerCockpitPage\n(/session/:hireSid)"
database PocketBase as "PocketBase"

== GM creates a hire ==

GameMaker -> AdminHome : Open hire dashboard
AdminHome -> PocketBase : listSessions WHERE gameMakerId = gm.uid
PocketBase --> AdminHome : home session + hire sessions

GameMaker -> AdminHome : "Add new hire" → name capture
AdminHome -> PocketBase : createSession(hireName, gameMakerId)
PocketBase --> AdminHome : hireSessionId
AdminHome -> HireDetail : navigate /admin/:homeSid/hire/:hireSid?new=1

== GM configures journey (or applies template) ==

GameMaker -> HireDetail : Customize tab
HireDetail -> PocketBase : milestones, missions, resources\n(via adapter on save)
note right of HireDetail
  **Templates (QoL):** import/export portable
  Milestones + Missions + FormSchemas + Resources.
  No player progress in templates.
end note

GameMaker -> HireDetail : Copy invite QR / link
note right of HireDetail
  Invite URL: {origin}/join/{hireSessionId}
  Scannable by any phone camera — plain HTTPS URI.
end note

== Player claims identity ==

NewHire -> Landing : Scan invite QR (no local identity)
Landing -> PocketBase : verifySession(hireSessionId)
Landing -> PocketBase : createPlayer + recoveryKey
Landing -> Landing : setIdentity(CachedIdentity) → localStorage
Landing -> Cockpit : navigate /session/:hireSessionId

== GM monitors progress ==

GameMaker -> AdminHome : Hire list (all owned sessions)
note right of AdminHome
  **Desired:** show joined AND not-joined hires.
  joined=false → status "Not joined yet".
  joined=true → progress %, stalled flag.
end note

GameMaker -> HireDetail : Analytics tab
HireDetail -> PocketBase : progress_events, players
HireDetail -> HireDetail : computeProgress → XP, approvals,\npeer scans, form responses

@enduml
